+# Corpus fetching
+
+The corpus fetch respected a per-domain limit of **12 visits per 60-second
+window**. Breaching that limit triggered a **900-second (15-minute) cooldown**
+for the affected domain.
+
+Files were fetched through these origin/CDN mirror hosts:
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com`
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net` (using `/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>` URLs)
+- `cdn.statically.io` (slow and subject to timeouts during the fetch)
